| 3 | **groq-voice** | Voice transcription (Groq Whisper) | groq.com (free) |
| 4 | **markdown-new** | Create markdown documents | none |
| 5 | **mcp-builder** | Build an MCP server | none |
| 6 | **memory-consolidate** | Distil episodic memory into durable insights | none |
| 7 | **second_brain-doctor** | Diagnose the shared brain end to end | none |
| 8 | **transcript** | Work with transcripts | none |

